WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.083
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:06.083 --> 00:00:07.666
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:09.875
and start getting Re-al.

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:10.666
This is

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:11.875
The Champions.

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:12.833
-Watch out!

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:15.333
Santa Klopp is coming to town!

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:18.750
-I like my candy canes Harry.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:23.583
-Hmmm. I suppose I should ask Santa for a real passport.

00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:26.666
-What gift can you give a man who has it all?

00:00:26.666 --> 00:00:28.291
-Uh, humility?

00:00:28.291 --> 00:00:30.833
-Oh, how much is that? I’ll buy 100 humilities.

00:00:51.708 --> 00:00:54.416
-It’s a holly jolly lolly golly Christmas Day!
-Ding dong ding dong

00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:56.166
-Fa la la la la la la la!
-Ding dong ding dong

00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:59.000
-Shoo! Shoo! Get out of here, Europa House urchins!

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Ew.

00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:02.000
Ooo, ooh.

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:05.625
I love Cristiano-mas.

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:07.708
It's a time to put aside our differences 

00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:09.833
and receive expensive gifts.

00:01:10.416 --> 00:01:13.916
Oooo! What is this? It's a squishy trophy. 

00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:14.916
Is it, uh,

00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:15.583
(sniffs)

00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:17.333
is it supposed to smell like this?

00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:21.041
-All right, all right, this one is for you, Robert. 

00:01:21.041 --> 00:01:23.583
-Oh cool, my dudes, you should not have!

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:27.375
Wow, it’s so big! It must be a-

00:01:27.375 --> 00:01:29.458
a Ballon d'Or?

00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:31.791
-Well, we figured you deserved it this year anyway and-

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.500
-Oh, wait wait wait. Hold on, hold on.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.875
Who are you to just give someone the Ballon d'Or?

00:01:36.375 --> 00:01:39.333
-I mean, he was the top scorer in the Bundesliga

00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:40.833
and the Champions League this year

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:42.916
and Bayern won the treble so-

00:01:42.916 --> 00:01:46.041
-OK, well if we're all just giving the awards to our teammates,

00:01:46.041 --> 00:01:49.708
uh, Ronaldo! For, uh, having the most Instagram followers,

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:51.583
you get the Ballon d'Or. Here.

00:01:51.583 --> 00:01:53.166
-No! Messi gets the Ballon d'Or

00:01:53.166 --> 00:01:54.500
for putting up with Bartomeu.

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:55.083
-(Grunting)

00:01:55.083 --> 00:01:56.500
-Give me that.
-Give it back you-

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.583
-Well, if we’re giving out the Ballon d'Or,

00:01:58.583 --> 00:02:01.041
I want the Lev Yashin Award for best goalkeeper!

00:02:01.041 --> 00:02:02.375
-Oh, like you would win!

00:02:02.375 --> 00:02:03.666
-I want a Grammy!

00:02:03.666 --> 00:02:05.208
-I want the Nobel Peace Prize, man!

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.875
-Oh, fart you!
-(Shouting)

00:02:07.875 --> 00:02:10.041
-(Whistle blow)

00:02:10.041 --> 00:02:12.208
-Here’s how we will settle this.

00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:14.875
We will all get dressed up and gather in the auditorium

00:02:14.875 --> 00:02:16.916
and I will host this year's Ballon d’Or.

00:02:16.916 --> 00:02:20.166
It will be a very tasteful ceremony

00:02:20.166 --> 00:02:23.500
as long as everybody follows my rules.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.250
OK?

00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:32.666
Here are the rules!

00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:34.083
Nine men enter!

00:02:34.083 --> 00:02:35.250
One man leaves!

00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:37.958
BEGIN!

00:02:37.958 --> 00:02:42.541
-(Shouting)

00:02:42.541 --> 00:02:44.500
-Who run Barca-town?!

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:45.333
-Wait. I don't get it,

00:02:45.333 --> 00:02:46.250
what are the teams?

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.791
-I am very confused!

00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:50.625
-Should half of us take our shirts off or something?

00:02:50.625 --> 00:02:52.833
-Why did you call it Beyond Ballon D'ome

00:02:52.833 --> 00:02:54.541
when all the important stuff happens

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:56.291
inside the Ballon D'ome?

00:02:56.666 --> 00:02:58.416
-Yeah, I guess I got carried away

00:02:58.416 --> 00:03:00.166
with all the cool costumes and production design

00:03:00.166 --> 00:03:02.708
and didn’t really think the rest of this concept through.

00:03:02.708 --> 00:03:04.375
OK, OK, new rules.

00:03:04.375 --> 00:03:05.458
How 'bout this:

00:03:05.458 --> 00:03:07.708
Four men enter.

00:03:07.708 --> 00:03:09.083
Two men leave.

00:03:09.083 --> 00:03:10.500
Those men advance to the knockout round.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.708
We do this eight times.

00:03:12.708 --> 00:03:13.708
Then we take those 16 men

00:03:13.708 --> 00:03:15.583
and put their names in a pot-

00:03:15.583 --> 00:03:17.083
-Hey look! It's snowing!

00:03:18.416 --> 00:03:20.291
-Woah, snowflakes.
-Snow.

00:03:20.291 --> 00:03:22.333
-Oh, it makes me so happy.

00:03:22.333 --> 00:03:23.416
I love the snow.

00:03:23.416 --> 00:03:24.416
It's a white Christmas.

00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:30.208
-I hate to be the interpreter of bad news,

00:03:30.208 --> 00:03:32.333
but that is just asbestos from the roof.

00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:33.500
-Oh no.
-Awww.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.291
-Not snow?

00:03:34.291 --> 00:03:35.291
-Now I'm sad.
-Dang it.

00:03:35.291 --> 00:03:37.125
-Guys, what are we doing?

00:03:37.125 --> 00:03:38.541
It's Christmas.

00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:41.083
We shouldn't be fighting over some award,

00:03:41.083 --> 00:03:42.666
we should be coming together.

00:03:43.166 --> 00:03:44.041
-Kevin.

00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:45.208
-Kevin's right.

00:03:45.208 --> 00:03:47.666
Robert, if anyone deserves the Ballon d'Or,

00:03:47.666 --> 00:03:48.833
it's you, man.

00:03:48.833 --> 00:03:50.333
You earned it.

00:03:55.708 --> 00:03:58.166
-Thank you, guys, that means a lot.

00:03:58.166 --> 00:04:01.750
And while I 100 percent deserve the award,

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:05.541
2020 has been hard on everybody.

00:04:05.541 --> 00:04:09.791
So how about this year we all share da Ballon d'Or?

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:21.916
-(Cheering)

00:04:21.916 --> 00:04:23.458
-Christmas! Christmas!

00:04:23.458 --> 00:04:26.666
-(Cheering)

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:27.666
-Gifts! Gifts!

00:04:27.666 --> 00:04:29.375
-Oh yeah!
--Everybody's a GOAT!

00:04:29.375 --> 00:04:31.333
-The Christmas spirit. I love it!

00:04:38.166 --> 00:04:38.958
-(Clears throat)

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.875
-VAR bless us, everyone.

00:04:50.791 --> 00:04:51.791
-Ho Ho

00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:52.791
(Yelling)

00:04:58.166 --> 00:05:00.375
-I need a break after being stuck here forever

00:05:00.375 --> 00:05:01.958
doing other people's laundry. 

00:05:01.958 --> 00:05:04.416
When booking my trip, I sometimes wonder,

00:05:04.416 --> 00:05:07.000
"What else could possibly go wrong?"

00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:14.208
I mean, that probably won't happen.

00:05:14.208 --> 00:05:15.583
But if my plans have to change

00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:16.333
it doesn't matter

00:05:16.333 --> 00:05:19.416
because Hotels.com has flexible booking options. 

00:05:19.416 --> 00:05:20.958
Hotels.com.

00:05:20.958 --> 00:05:23.541
Because just in case.

00:05:48.666 --> 00:05:50.541
-Like and subscribe to B/R Football

00:05:50.541 --> 00:05:52.916
or I'll kick you in the jingle balls.

